        pre_narrative: `The Structure Saboteur has constructed a passage that uses correlative conjunctions — the hardest parallel structure to detect in context. The passage looks balanced at every glance. You must read slowly and look at what comes immediately after each half of each correlative pair.`,
        passage: `The new archivist was not only respected by her colleagues but also the younger Scholars admired her. She believed that either you learn grammar through careful study, or by practicing it obsessively. Her mentor had told her both that mastery requires patience and to never stop revising.`,
