        pre_narrative: `The Parallel Predator has been following you since the first pillar. It is patient, and it has saved its best trap for near the end. It presents a passage that uses a complex list within a "not only...but also" construction — a nested parallel problem that most Scholars miss entirely.`,
        passage: `The Scholar's revised proposal was not only more thorough than the previous draft but also organized more clearly, argued more persuasively, and including new evidence from the restricted archives. The Committee, having read both versions, agreed that the revision demonstrated both a stronger command of the subject matter and that she had improved her ability to present arguments.`,
