        pre_narrative: `The Dangling Participle sinks partially below the surface, leaving only its upper form visible. From just below the waterline, it projects a passage onto the fog — a misplaced modifier embedded in a multi-sentence excerpt that requires reading all of it to find the error's exact location and nature.`,
        passage: `[1] The Archives Committee had convened to discuss the proposed expansion. [2] The new wing would house scrolls from three additional eras of the Keep's history. [3] Presenting the proposal to the full Committee, the scrolls were described by the Scholar as irreplaceable documents that demanded immediate preservation. [4] The Committee voted unanimously to approve the expansion.`,
