        passage: `[1] The Scholar had spent the better part of a decade researching the Keep's founding documents. [2] Having cross-referenced over three thousand individual scrolls and consulting with every living expert on the subject, her conclusions were considered definitive by the Archives Council. [3] No previous researcher had achieved such comprehensive coverage of the primary sources.`,
